status GREEN -- say_compose_bound and shim_reason both green together, the control at 41 legs and 0 red with each new wall mutated in turn and its own legs watched to fall, all sixteen touched amphora witnesses re-run green, the guarded refusal path proven by breaking a build in a pen, index_row_bound and fold_shelf_link green. The first hot close read 237 green, 2 red -- my own red closed, and shim_reason opened in its place from this lap's own repair; the second hot close over exactly what ships reads 239 green, 0 red, 3 gated, tree_moved=no, run_verdict=ok -- the whole roster clean, and both reds the cold open named are closed.
recommend keep-going -- the ferry's two walks in amphora/src/main.rye still count without a ceiling, where the Return is bounded by the listing it reads; every resins home on this pier holds 2 bodies and one pour writes at most max_season_files, so the bound is a refusal about scale and wants its reason written down rather than a number invented
